==Miscellaneous==
*Drop rates for [[Catfruit]] changed on Insane stages, applies to [[Catfruit Buffet]] but not [[Catfruit Jubilee]].
*Certain cat units target [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie Enemies]] and/or gain [[Zombie Killer]] as well as other changes.
**[[Delinquent Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Delinquent Cat]] receives Immune to Freeze.
**[[Sumo Cat (Special Cat)|Riceball Cat]] receives Immune to Knockback.
**[[Kung Fu Cat (Special Cat)|Dancer Cat]] receives Immune to Weaken.
*[[CyberFace]] now moves at 32 speed instead of 42.
*[[Zyclone]] now revives infinitely instead of only 99 times.
*[[Miss Haka]] and [[Big Sal]] now burrow infinitely instead of only 9,999 times.

